{"parse": {"title": "冰原时隙-04", "pageid": 107411, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-03\" title=\"冰原时隙-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">冰原时隙-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-05\" title=\"冰原时隙-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">冰原时隙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E6.AC.A1.E5.8D.8F.E4.BD.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一次协作\">一次协作</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一次协作</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Cooperation</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>距离安德烈小队失联二十九个小时。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虽然被迫提前一个小时结束了休息，但队长在崭新的路线规划图前露出了衷心的笑容</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>搜索范围至少扩大了百分之三十，如果是这样的话，我们甚至来得及赶在三十六小时内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>是的，队长。如果我的计算无误的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>我们都很相信您，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我想你应该还有一个问题没有提出？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>第四支救援队在哪里？托勒密步兵班的救援不可能这么快过来，丹尼洛夫和他的飞机也还留守在驻地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>情况确实如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>难道说，我们要和……一起合作吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在提到合作者的时候，他只动了动嘴唇，没有发出声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>这是我希望和你一起讨论的部分，队长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>关于是否应该在紧急状况下，接纳临时加入的神秘学动物参与搜救。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>神秘学动物？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队长认真地咀嚼了一番这个意料之外的词语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>是犬类吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>是神秘学松鼠。还有三只普通的阿德利企鹅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>……松鼠？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队长的眉头皱起来，像是一道皲裂的冰川。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>你是说，营地忽然出现了身份不明的神秘学生物，而你打算和它合作？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>不能算是完全身份不明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我想我听说过它，你也是，队长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>我可不认识什么神秘学松鼠……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>在……去年的一次午餐趣事分享上，我记得你也在座，但或许你没有留意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队长面露恍然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>我们已经很久没有过这个环节了，自从……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回想戛然而止，他看了看莫莉德尔，中尉的脸像是还没融化的冰面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>我好像有印象了。所以，我们能相信它吗？我是说那只松鼠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我们的时间不多了……戴维德的时间不多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉的声音轻了下去，像裂开的冰面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从不放任冰面开裂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>还有一个情报需要和你分享，稍后我也会通知所有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>如果松鼠和它提供的消息可信的话，我们可能不得不做出一些额外的预案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>对什么的预案？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉没有立刻回答他，她正谨慎地斟酌合适的用词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>可能存在的精神失常，谵妄，还有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看着地图上那只手掌般的漆黑标记，动了动嘴唇，同样没有出声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>氛围像暴风雪夜的帐篷顶一样沉重冻结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>无论如何，午餐趣事分享没能说服我，我不赞成引入陌生的人或者什么动物参与我们的活动，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我认为它有着足够高贵的品格，队长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队长露出极不赞同的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>高贵的品格？抱歉，但一只松鼠？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>是的。一只为了三只素未蒙面的企鹅，穿越了八千多公里来到南极的松鼠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>戴维德不用寄望于成为第四只幸运的企鹅并为此承担风险，中尉。我相信这里至少有十个人愿意为了他穿越八千公里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队长表达了他的顾虑，而中尉抿紧了嘴唇作为回应。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嚼嚼松果对正围绕着自己的严肃探讨一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠正惬意地和企鹅们躺成一团，享受着彼此柔软的毛发或绒羽，就像过往一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>伙计们，你们猜怎么的？我可不喜欢等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>基金会的人就总是让我等待——事实上就是置之不理，想让问题自己消失！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>但中尉是个好人，她帮了咱们的忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我刚才确实有点兴奋，伙计们，我想我们还是得留个心眼儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>总之，如果她想让咱们干什么很危险的事儿，咱们就脚底抹油。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎嘎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>没错，绒毛公爵，这可是咱们的强项。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠忽然抖动了一下耳朵，军靴的声音正在由远及近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>希望你们昨晚休息得很好，我的朋友们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>当然，谢谢你的招待，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>出于一些原因，我无法提供正式的待遇，只能代表我个人提出一个请求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>请求？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我们正在搜救几名走失的队员，时间紧迫，非常需要你们的协助，嚼嚼松果先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>先生？哦，当然，嚼嚼松果先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠抱起前爪，在桌上走了两圈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>在南极走失了，这可真不得了。你们确实需要一些更熟悉地形的帮手！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>伙计们，怎么说？中尉和她的朋友需要帮助，而我们欠了她一个人情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524802.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-524802.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524802.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524802.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-524802.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524802.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-524802.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524802.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>确实，这很公平。我们接受你的请求，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>非常感激你的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>这可能会不可避免地有些危险，但我一定会极力保证你和你朋友们的安全。并且承诺尽我所能，为你们争取正式的待遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠有些不耐烦地用尾巴拍了拍桌面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这些等之后再说！时间紧迫，你的队员们有危险，咱们可得抓紧点儿才行。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "冰原时隙-04"}}